  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Spell. You create Savannah Heat at target foe's location. For 5 seconds, all nearby foes take 5...17...20 fire damage for each second this spell has been in effect.",
      "zhTW": "在目標敵人所在地點創造燎原之火。持續 5 秒，使附近的所有敵人每秒受到 5～20 火焰傷害，並且在此「魔法」的持續時間中每秒再附加 5～20 額外火焰傷害。"
    },
    "pvp": {
